  "text_off": 5310,
  "text_len": 12
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:014D9",
  "jp": "カスミ「あっ‥‥え、えっと、そういう意味じゃなくて、{nl}　大切な思い出で、でもそれは終わったとかそういうんじゃ{nl}　なくて、まだこれからもたくさん思い出を作りたいって{nl}　思ってるし、それにこれで終わりとかしたくないし、{nl}　ずっと、ずっと終わりにしたくないって思ってるし、{nl}{ctl:3C3E}{face:841A02}{ctl:013E}{face:841903}{ctl:023E}{face:841907}　えっと、えっと‥‥」",
  "off": 5337,
  "len": 190,
  "en": "Kasumi: Ah... Um, I-I didn't mean it like that, it's a precious memory, but that doesn't mean it's over or anything, I still want to make lots more memories from now on, and I don't want it to end here, I don't ever, ever want it to end, and...{ctl:3C3E}{face:841A02}{ctl:013E}{face:841903}{ctl:023E}{face:841907} Um, um...",
  "status": "translated",
