  "len": 13,
  "en": "Touya: What the!?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6382,
  "text_len": 10
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:018FC",
  "jp": "デロック「は、はははははは‥‥それじゃ」",
  "off": 6396,
  "len": 25,
  "en": "Derock: Ha, hahahahahaha... Well then, y'see.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6398,
  "text_len": 22
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:0191C",
  "jp": "ヤマト「‥‥あたし達も行こうか」",
  "off": 6428,
  "len": 23,
  "en": "Yamato: ...Shall we go too?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6430,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01936",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あ、ああ」",
  "off": 6454,
  "len": 12,
  "en": "Touya: Y-yeah.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6456,
  "text_len": 9
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:019FE",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あれ？　エレベーターが動いてる。めずらしいわね。{nl}　誰か乗ってるのかしら？」",
  "off": 6654,
  "len": 52,
  "en": "Yamato: Huh? The elevator's moving. That's rare. I wonder if someone's riding it?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6656,
  "text_len": 49
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01A35",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そりゃ、乗るだろ」",
  "off": 6709,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Touya: Well, yeah, people ride it.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6711,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01A49",
  "jp": "ヤマト「でも、あたしが見るときはいつも止まってるよ。{nl}　しかもちょうどその階に」",
  "off": 6729,
  "len": 46,
  "en": "Yamato: But whenever I look, it's always stopped. And right on this floor, too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6731,
  "text_len": 43
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01A7A",
  "jp": "トウヤ「気のせいだ。気のせい。それより‥‥」",
  "off": 6778,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Touya: Your imagination. Just your imagination. More importantly...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6780,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01AA1",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あっ、止まった」",
  "off": 6817,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Yamato: Oh, it stopped.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6819,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce114:01ABB",
  "jp": "フェイン「はははははははっ！{nl}　愛する人を守る為、正義の刃が敵を撃つ！{nl}　赤い血潮を真っ赤に燃やし、それが男の生きる道！{nl}　正義と真実の男！{nl}　フェイィィン、ジィィン、バァァァリィオォォン‼{nl}　只今、推参！　正義のためなら‥‥死ねる」",
  "off": 6843,
  "len": 158,
  "en": "Fain: Hahahahahahaha! To protect the one I love, the blade of justice strikes the foe! Setting my red blood ablaze, such is the path a man must walk! The man of justice and truth! Faaaain, Jiiiin, Baaariooooon!! Now arriving! For justice... I would die.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6845,
  "text_len": 155
 },
 {
